laurel 2960: iOS 16 EL0 LSE emulation (topaz 0081). The table end moves after the four ranges (a fault in an emulated word was a panic); LDUMIN uses the flags of the values (it always stored the operand); a bad pointer gives EXC_BAD_ACCESS, also with the second vm_fault, not EXC_BAD_INSTRUCTION; top byte ignored; LDAPR with other A, R stays undefined. iOS 16 only: patches/laurel/xnu-12377/skip.txt. Test: scripts/laurel/test-lse0081.sh.

--- a/osfmk/arm64/machine_routines_asm.s
